s11-p3 = prose (cons "These are not operations performed from an unexplained vantage outside the system. The observer, its interpretation, and its reasoning can be included in the described evolution. The definitions of the language that expresses those relations can themselves be represented as terms, and operations on those definitions can themselves be interpreted, checked, specialized, and transformed. A routine, a relation on its behavior, and a rationale for that relation are constructions in one language, not three authorities between which the engineer must translate." nil)
